---
source: src/tests/robustness_tests.rs
expression: catalog
---
# generator outcome per matrix off-limits (reject-class) construct — a SCORECARD, not a contract.
# Heterogeneous by design: parse-rejected rows record `error (graceful)`, generates-but-doesn't-
# compile rows record `ok` (generate-only can't see the later failure), out-of-profile panics record
# `PANIC`. A row flipping `error (graceful)` -> `ok` means a rejected construct started PARSING (the
# cddl-fork-bump regression class) — investigate, don't blindly re-bless. project_robustness.ts --check
# pins each row's expected label to its matrix evidence class. Source: cddl-matrix/project_robustness.ts.

ctl.cborseq                        error (graceful)
ctl.oid                            error (graceful)
ctl.sdnv                           error (graceful)
ctl.sdnvseq                        error (graceful)
prelude.any                        ok
type2.tag_head_type                PANIC
value.bytes                        error (graceful)
